    "description": {
      "content": "REST API for managing build definitions, queuing builds, and retrieving build results, artifacts, tags, and logs in Azure DevOps. Supports the full lifecycle of continuous integration builds including creating and updating build definitions, listing and filtering builds by status and result, tagging builds for identification, and downloading build artifacts.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Microsoft Azure DevOps",
